    <!-- Control Center tile. -->
    <string name="tile_card_title">Control Center tile</string>
    <string name="tile_card_body">If HyperOS stops the gesture service while the navigation bar is hidden, Back and Home are gone. Control Center still opens from the top of the screen, and this tile shows whether your gestures are running. When they are stopped, a tap on it opens accessibility settings.</string>
